  "notes": "Schedule = static TMHP 'DENTAL' fee schedule (PRCR496C), modified date 9/14/2026 on the page. Used rows for provider type 'TEXAS HEALTH STEPS - DENTAL', Non-facility 'Medicaid Fee' column; fees identical across the other dental provider types except as noted. All listed dental codes are THSteps (children, under 21) benefits; Texas Medicaid has no adult comprehensive dental FFS fees in this schedule, so all fees recorded as 'child'. Per-code 'Fee Effect Date' varies: 29 codes 2026-09-01, 31 codes 2025-09-01, D8070/D8080 2024-10-01, D0140 2025-03-01, D2394 2018-09-01. effective_date = most recent fee effect date in the file. Note codes on restorations: fee is for a permanent tooth; primary tooth paid at a % (D2140 94.31% [D7], D2150 94.79% [D8], D2391 91.56% [D6], D2392 89.82% [D5], D2393 & D2394 86.09% [D3]). D9222: base row 58.50; with modifier UZ 81.76 (recorded base row only). D8090 not in schedule. Most Texas Medicaid/CHIP children's dental is delivered via dental managed care (DMOs), whose rates may differ. Age ranges printed (Frm-Thru, units): D0120 0-20 years; D0140 0-20 years; D0150 0-20 years; D0210 2-20 years; D0220 1-20 years; D0274 2-20 years; D0330 3-20 years; D1110 13-20 years; D1120 6-155 months; D1206 6-251 months; D1351 1-20 years; D2140 0-20 years; D2150 0-20 years; D2391 0-20 years; D2392 0-20 years; D2393 1-20 years; D2394 1-20 years; D2740 13-20 years; D2750 13-20 years; D2751 13-20 years; D2752 13-20 years; D2790 13-20 years; D2930 0-20 years; D2950 4-20 years; D2962 13-20 years; D3220 0-20 years; D3310 6-20 years; D3320 6-20 years; D3330 6-20 years; D3346 6-20 years; D3347 6-20 years; D3348 6-20 years; D4341 13-20 years; D4342 13-20 years; D4355 13-20 years; D4910 13-20 years; D5110 3-20 years; D5120 3-20 years; D5211 6-20 years; D5212 6-20 years; D5213 9-20 years; D5214 9-20 years; D5820 3-20 years; D5821 3-20 years; D6240 16-20 years; D6245 16-20 years; D6750 16-20 years; D6740 16-20 years; D6790 16-20 years; D7140 0-20 years; D72